WEBVTT

00:05:27.038 --> 00:05:31.538
but it's always changing as young ones
start moving up a hierarchy starting at

00:05:31.538 --> 00:05:33.663
the bottom when they're
in late adolescence.

00:05:34.204 --> 00:05:40.413
And the interesting thing is they have
different methods of climbing the ladder.

00:05:40.954 --> 00:05:46.329
And when you consider those who've made it
to the top, the alpha males, you know,

00:05:46.329 --> 00:05:49.663
there are some who just
use physical strength,

00:05:50.121 --> 00:05:53.621
aggressive and slightly brutal
and do a lot of attacking.

00:05:54.371 --> 00:05:59.163
They don't last as long as those
that use their intelligence

00:05:59.704 --> 00:06:02.996
and they use that intelligence
in different ways.